      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_30a764bd",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: shut_up_you_meathead; hasOverallIntent: Abusive; overall-intent-description: The image features an older man in formal attire with the text 'shut up you meathead' superimposed. The meme uses a juxtaposition of the man's seemingly benign or neutral expression with the aggressive, insulting text to create a humorous or mocking effect. The term 'meathead' is a derogatory slang term used to describe someone as foolish, dense, or lacking intelligence, often implying physical or mental incompetence. While not targeting a specific protected group (race, gender, religion, etc.), the intent is clearly abusive and demeaning toward the individual depicted, using crude language to insult his perceived intelligence or character. The meme's overall intent is to mock or belittle the person, fitting the category of abusive content as it is designed to provoke a negative reaction or ridicule through verbal aggression.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_1b172466"
      },
